    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06724618833eb42696f81a57",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥一边沉思一边开始走。跟在她身后，\n远远望见广场上有小赛马娘们在奔跑着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8368d83a70fed981fad512b9d4b3d741d4cb7f9728fe5204a02bd8d4bca4364b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
