      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那份近乎本能的，想要奔跑的冲动……与生俱来的力量之强――\n赛马娘身上，拥有许多人类所没有的特质。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eefa81e66090a877926d9e3564743e0d8a88836a1f173233a0fb25722062f99",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
