      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "了解该如何面对这些特质，是一件非常重要的事。\n因为这是赛马娘生存方式的，根本所在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de4f3c93b011a581a231b9fce1054d4768f1af2175be5eda83aef4fea2059202",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
