      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论形式如何……引导后辈的赛马娘们\n都肩负着无比重大的使命，这一点不会改变。",
      "source_fingerprint": "337af2b48ffd3af806028f55796d65c3dbaadc12cf50dac858454ddf360c4b54",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
